# .vibe/auditignore — suppresses KNOWN false positives in the audit
# scanners AND the pre-commit secret hook (v0.5.1+).
# Gitignore-style globs, one per line. Use sparingly and justify every entry:
# an ignored file is a blind spot for the secret/LGPD scanners.
# v0.9+: prefer the inline reason format (`path  # reason`) — the audit
# reports entries without one, and overly broad patterns are flagged.
#
# --- VibeHarness self-scan exclusions -------------------------------------
# Test files contain INTENTIONAL fake-secret fixtures (PEM blocks, AWS keys,
# CORS/JWT snippets, PII strings, MD5 calls) used to verify the scanners.
tests/packager.test.ts  # intentional fake-secret fixtures for packager redaction tests
tests/security.test.ts  # intentional fake-secret fixtures for the secret scanner tests
tests/lgpd.test.ts  # intentional fake-PII/CPF fixtures for the LGPD scanner tests
# The LGPD scanner's own pattern definitions match themselves when read
# as file content (md5/INSERT-password regex sources).
src/scanners/lgpd.ts  # scanner's own regex sources self-match (md5/INSERT-password patterns)
# The infra scanner's fix text embeds a literal route example
# (app.get("/healthz")) that trips the web-surface detection.
src/scanners/infra.ts  # scanner's own fix-text embeds a literal /healthz route example
# CLI output lines that mention "secret(s)" trip the PII-in-logs heuristic
# (they print UI text, not user data).
src/commands/doctor.ts  # CLI output text mentions "secret(s)" — UI copy, not user data
# The pre-commit hook snippet embeds the secret-detection patterns themselves
# (moved from src/commands/init.ts to the headless action in v0.7.0).
src/actions/init.ts  # pre-commit hook snippet embeds the detection patterns themselves
# The security scanner's pattern definitions contain the secret literals
# themselves; the packager documents the prefixes it redacts.
src/scanners/security.ts  # scanner's own SECRET_PATTERNS definitions (regex sources)
src/packager/index.ts  # packager documents the vendor prefixes it redacts
# Recipes: documents Stripe key prefixes in .env.example hints.
src/core/recipes.ts  # documents Stripe key prefixes in .env.example hints
# Docs that quote the patterns being detected (kept out of the hook's grep).
CHANGELOG.md  # release notes quote the detected vendor prefixes
